---
layout: base.njk
title: Give
description: Choose an amount and see what it pays for. Give once or monthly by mobile money or bank transfer.
permalink: /donate/index.html
---
<section class="page-hero">
  <div class="wrap">
    <p class="crumbs"><a href="/">Home</a> &rsaquo; Give</p>
    <h1>Choose an amount. See what it buys.</h1>
    <p>We would rather tell you exactly what your money becomes than ask you to trust us.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="sec">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="give-grid">
      <div>
        <div class="toggle" id="freq-toggle" role="group" aria-label="Give once or monthly">
          <button type="button" data-mode="once" aria-pressed="true">Give once</button>
          <button type="button" data-mode="monthly" aria-pressed="false">Give monthly</button>
        </div>

        <div class="amounts" role="group" aria-label="Choose an amount in Ghana cedis">
          <button class="amt" type="button" data-amount="50" aria-pressed="false"
            data-once="Provides sanitary materials for a group of adolescent girls for a full term."
            data-monthly="Keeps a group of girls supplied with sanitary materials all year round.">GH&#8373;50</button>
          <button class="amt" type="button" data-amount="150" aria-pressed="false"
            data-once="Provides food items for elderly people and persons living with disabilities."
            data-monthly="Supports elderly households with food every month of the year.">GH&#8373;150</button>
          <button class="amt" type="button" data-amount="400" aria-pressed="true"
            data-once="Covers materials and transport for one school mentorship and health session."
            data-monthly="Puts our team into one school every month of the school year.">GH&#8373;400</button>
          <button class="amt" type="button" data-amount="1000" aria-pressed="false"
            data-once="Buys the tools or equipment one woman needs to start earning for herself."
            data-monthly="Equips one woman to become self-reliant, every month.">GH&#8373;1,000</button>
          <button class="amt" type="button" data-amount="5000" aria-pressed="false"
            data-once="Underwrites a full community outreach day across the municipality."
            data-monthly="Underwrites a full outreach day every single month.">GH&#8373;5,000</button>
        </div>

        <p class="effect" id="effect" role="status">Covers materials and transport for one school mentorship and health session.</p>

        <div class="custom">
          <label for="custom-amount">Other amount in Ghana cedis</label>
          <input id="custom-amount" type="number" min="1" step="1" placeholder="Other amount (GH&#8373;)" inputmode="numeric">
          <a class="btn btn-dark" href="#how-to-pay" id="give-btn">Give GH&#8373;400</a>
        </div>

        <div class="pay" id="how-to-pay">
          <h3>Ways to give</h3>
          <ul>
            {% if site.momoMtn and not site.momoMtn.startsWith("[") %}<li><b>MTN MoMo</b> &mdash; {{ site.momoMtn }}</li>{% endif %}
            {% if site.momoTelecel and not site.momoTelecel.startsWith("[") %}<li><b>Telecel Cash</b> &mdash; {{ site.momoTelecel }}</li>{% endif %}
            {% if site.momoAt and not site.momoAt.startsWith("[") %}<li><b>AT Money</b> &mdash; {{ site.momoAt }}</li>{% endif %}
            {% if site.bank and not site.bank.startsWith("[") %}<li><b>Bank transfer</b> &mdash; {{ site.bank }}</li>{% endif %}
            <li><b>By phone</b> &mdash; call us on {{ site.phone }} and we will tell you the quickest way to give</li>
            <li><b>In person</b> &mdash; visit us in {{ site.addressLine1 }}, or speak to any member of the team at an outreach</li>
          </ul>
          <p style="margin-top:1rem;color:var(--muted);font-size:.95rem">
            Please use your own name as the payment reference so we can thank you properly. If you would rather give quietly, use the word ANON instead.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="other-ways">
        <article>
          <h3>Give in kind</h3>
          <p>Sanitary materials, food items, hospital consumables, exercise books, tools and equipment all go straight to where they are needed. Tell us what you have and we will say honestly whether we can use it.</p>
          <a class="link" href="/contact/">Ask what is needed</a>
        </article>
        <article>
          <h3>Give your time</h3>
          <p>No outreach happens without volunteers &mdash; serving food, carrying items, registering guests, taking photographs.</p>
          <a class="link" href="/contact/">Volunteer with us</a>
        </article>
        <article>
          <h3>Companies and institutions</h3>
          <p>We will report back with photographs and figures after every outreach we run together.</p>
          <a class="link" href="/contact/">Talk to us about partnership</a>
        </article>
        <article>
          <h3>Mark an occasion</h3>
          <p>Birthdays, funerals, weddings, harvests. Ask your guests to give to an outreach in your name and we will name the occasion when we deliver.</p>
          <a class="link" href="/contact/">Tell us what you are planning</a>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="sec sec-light">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head"><h2>Questions people ask.</h2></div>
    <div class="faq">
      <details>
        <summary>How do I know the money reached the people you say?</summary>
        <p>Every outreach is written up on this site and posted on our Facebook page, with photographs and the names of those who received the donation where they have agreed to be named.</p>
      </details>
      <details>
        <summary>Can I choose which programme my gift supports?</summary>
        <p>Yes &mdash; tell us when you give and we will apply it to health and dignity, social support, economic empowerment, or education and advocacy. If you do not specify, we use it where the need is greatest that month.</p>
      </details>
      <details>
        <summary>Can I give from outside Ghana?</summary>
        <p>Yes. Write to us at {{ site.email }} and we will send you transfer details. We are working on adding card payments so gifts from abroad can be made directly on this page.</p>
      </details>
      <details>
        <summary>Is the foundation registered?</summary>
        {% if site.registration and not site.registration.startsWith("[") %}<p>Yes. We are registered in Ghana, registration number {{ site.registration }}.</p>{% else %}<p>Registration with the Registrar-General's Department and the Department of Social Welfare is in progress. We would rather tell you that plainly than leave the question unanswered, and we will publish the numbers here as soon as they are issued.</p>{% endif %}
      </details>
      <details>
        <summary>Will you keep contacting me?</summary>
        <p>Only if you ask us to. We do not sell or share supporter details with anyone. See our <a href="/privacy/">privacy notice</a>.</p>
      </details>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
